-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §24 מנהל קיים: an existing principal of a
-- school that applies the reform is paid a transition supplement of 50% on
-- the combined salary and the 1994, 2001 and 2008 supplements, which enters
-- the base of three allowances only and carries pension contributions in
-- place of severance; from the year the reform is applied in full, an Oz
-- LaTmura supplement for principals of 30% on the combined salary alone, a
-- separate component that enters no other supplement's base and counts for
-- the hour value, severance and the pension and training funds; §18 on the
-- training allowance; and his other components as the collective
-- agreements set them.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-4`
IMPORT `oz-founding-18`

§ `24 מנהל קיים`

@desc The salary components §24's supplements are computed on, at the principal's own values.
DECLARE `Oz principal's salary components` HAS
    `the combined salary` IS A NUMBER @desc השכר המשולב
    `the 1994 supplement` IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת 94'
    `the 2001 supplement` IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת 2001
    `the 2008 supplement` IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת 2008

§§ `24(א)`

-- (א): an existing principal (§4(ו)) serving in a school that applies the
-- reform — in full or in part; (ד) says "באופן מלא" where it means in
-- full — is entitled to a wage supplement of 50%, computed on the combined
-- salary, the 1994, the 2001 and the 2008 supplements: "תוספת מעבר
-- לרפורמה".
@ref akn:art_24__para_a
`the transition supplement rate` MEANS 50%

GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the transition supplement` m e IF
        `an existing principal under the Oz agreement` m
    AND NOT e EQUALS `off the Oz reform`

GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, c IS A `Oz principal's salary components`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the transition supplement for` m e c IS
    IF `entitled to the transition supplement` m e
    THEN `the transition supplement rate` TIMES
             (c's `the combined salary` PLUS c's `the 1994 supplement` PLUS c's `the 2001 supplement` PLUS c's `the 2008 supplement`)
    ELSE 0

§§ `24(ב)`

-- (ב): the transition supplement is not in the base of any other
-- supplement, save the training allowance, the degree allowance (M.A. and
-- Ph.D.) and the profession and training allowance. The exceptions are a
-- closed list (convention reading.closed-list): the management allowance,
-- which (ח) names among the principal's other components, is not among
-- them.
@ref akn:art_24__para_b
DECLARE `supplement on an Oz principal's salary` IS ONE OF
    `the principal's training allowance`
    `the principal's degree allowance (M.A. and Ph.D.)`
    `the principal's profession and training allowance`
    `the principal's management allowance`
    `another supplement on the principal's salary`

GIVEN s IS A `supplement on an Oz principal's salary`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the transition supplement is in the base of` s IF
        s EQUALS `the principal's training allowance`
    OR s EQUALS `the principal's degree allowance (M.A. and Ph.D.)`
    OR s EQUALS `the principal's profession and training allowance`

§§ `24(ג)`

-- (ג): on the transition supplement contributions are made to a pension
-- provident fund at the rates §46 sets out; the contribution in place of
-- severance (§46(ה)) takes the place of the whole 100% of the severance pay
-- for this component, under §14 of the Severance Pay Law, 1963. §46 is
-- not encoded yet: its rate is an input.
@ref akn:art_24__para_c
GIVEN `the transition supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the rate section 46 sets` IS A NUMBER @desc the contribution rate §46 sets for the fund and the part of it (benefits, or in place of severance)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pension contribution on the transition supplement` `the transition supplement` `the rate section 46 sets` IS
    `the rate section 46 sets` TIMES `the transition supplement`

`the contribution in place of severance on the transition supplement replaces all its severance pay` MEANS TRUE

`why the pension contribution rates are an input` MEANS
    `not yet encoded` "סעיף 46 להסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), הפרשות לקופת גמל לקצבה"

`why section 14 of the Severance Pay Law is not encoded` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק פיצויי פיטורים, התשכ\"ג-1963, סעיף 14"

-- What §24 brings the transition supplement into account for: the pension
-- fund, and severance through the contribution in its place. (The base of
-- the hour value is §15(א)(2)'s, which takes in every monthly percentage
-- supplement.) (ב) and (ג) say nothing of a training fund, which (ו) names
-- for the principals' Oz LaTmura supplement beside them
-- (F-oz-founding-24-a). The reading adopted (convention reading.contrast):
-- where §24 says it of one supplement and not of the other, the other is
-- not brought into the training fund.
GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 24 brings the transition supplement into account for` p IF
        p EQUALS `contributions to a pension provident fund`
    OR p EQUALS `Oz severance pay under the Severance Pay Law`

§§ `24(ד)–(ו)`

-- (ד): besides it, an existing principal is entitled, from the school year
-- in which the reform was applied in full, to a wage supplement of 30%,
-- computed on the combined salary alone: "תוספת עוז לתמורה - מנהלים". How
-- far the reform reaches his school in a year is §5's; the rule asks it of
-- the year. (In the years of part application §31(א) sets other rates; not
-- encoded yet.)
@ref akn:art_24__para_d
`the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals rate` MEANS 30%

GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals` m e IF
        `an existing principal under the Oz agreement` m
    AND e EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`

GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, c IS A `Oz principal's salary components`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals for` m e c IS
    IF `entitled to the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals` m e
    THEN `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals rate` TIMES c's `the combined salary`
    ELSE 0

`why the rates for principals in part application are not here` MEANS
    `not yet encoded` "סעיף 31 להסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), תוספת עוז לתמורה למנהלים ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה"

-- (ה): it is in the base of no other wage supplement. (ו): it is paid as a
-- separate component and brought into account for the hour value, for
-- severance pay under the Severance Pay Law, and for contributions to a
-- pension provident fund and to a training fund. A closed list (convention
-- reading.closed-list): not the Dafna fund.
@ref akn:art_24__para_e akn:art_24__para_f
`the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals is a separate salary component` MEANS TRUE

GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals counts for` p IF
        p EQUALS `computing the hour value`
    OR p EQUALS `Oz severance pay under the Severance Pay Law`
    OR p EQUALS `contributions to a pension provident fund`
    OR p EQUALS `contributions to a training fund`

§§ `24(ז)`

-- (ז): §18 applies to an existing principal serving in a school that has
-- applied the reform, on the training allowance: its rules read him as
-- they read a teacher, from תשע"ב.
@ref akn:art_24__para_g
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 18 applies to an existing principal in` y m e IF
        `an existing principal under the Oz agreement` m
    AND `section 18 applies in` y e

§§ `24(ח)`

-- (ח): the agreement does not change the collective agreements on a
-- principal's other salary components, the management allowance among
-- them, which apply to the existing principals — subject to §22. They are
-- not this agreement's.
@ref akn:art_24__para_h
`why an existing principal's other components are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "ההסכמים הקיבוציים בעניין רכיבי השכר האחרים של מנהלי בתי ספר, גמול ניהול בכללם, החלים על המנהלים הקיימים"

§§ `24 -- illustrations`

`components of 20,000 with 600, 400 and 300` MEANS
    `Oz principal's salary components` WITH
        `the combined salary` IS 20000
        `the 1994 supplement` IS 600
        `the 2001 supplement` IS 400
        `the 2008 supplement` IS 300

`an existing principal` MEANS `a serving principal of` `a six-year school, grades 7 to 12`

-- 50% of 21,300; in a school in part application too
#ASSERT `the transition supplement for` `an existing principal` `the Oz reform in part` `components of 20,000 with 600, 400 and 300` EQUALS 10650
#ASSERT `the transition supplement for` `an existing principal` `off the Oz reform` `components of 20,000 with 600, 400 and 300` EQUALS 0
-- 30% of the combined salary alone, in a school in full application only
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals for` `an existing principal` `the Oz reform in full` `components of 20,000 with 600, 400 and 300` EQUALS 6000
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals for` `an existing principal` `the Oz reform in part` `components of 20,000 with 600, 400 and 300` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the transition supplement is in the base of` `the principal's degree allowance (M.A. and Ph.D.)`
#ASSERT NOT `the transition supplement is in the base of` `the principal's management allowance`
#ASSERT `the pension contribution on the transition supplement` 10650 (6%) EQUALS 639
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals counts for` `computing the hour value`
#ASSERT NOT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals counts for` `contributions to the Dafna fund`
#ASSERT NOT `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals counts for` `computing another percentage supplement on the combined salary`
#ASSERT `section 18 applies to an existing principal in` `the school year 5772` `an existing principal` `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT NOT `section 18 applies to an existing principal in` `the school year 5772` `an existing principal` `off the Oz reform`

-- F-oz-founding-24-a's evidence: (ו) brings the principals' Oz LaTmura
-- supplement into the training fund, and (ב)–(ג) say no such thing of the
-- transition supplement beside it.
`section 24 names a training fund for one of its supplements only` MEANS
        `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals counts for` `contributions to a training fund`
    AND NOT `section 24 brings the transition supplement into account for` `contributions to a training fund`
    AND `section 24 brings the transition supplement into account for` `contributions to a pension provident fund`
#ASSERT `section 24 names a training fund for one of its supplements only`
